   "text": "Istituto Marangoni Paris - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nIstituto Marangoni Paris\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nList of Testimonials\nSearch Institution Testimonials\nSEARCH\nMANAGE FILTERS\nREFRESH\n1 item available\nSorted by {0} descending\nColumn headers with buttons are sortable\nImage\n\t\nStudent Name\n\t\nComment\n\t\nCreated\n\t\nOlga\nBA Fashion Business\n\t\nLuctions were very interesting. I especially remember the visual merchandising workshop. We analyzed shop windows in the Golden Square. The teacher decided not to show us the photos, but to go on a study tour of the city. We appreciated the window dr....Show More\n\t\nApr 2, 2021\nData Migration",
